#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
msgid ""
"If checked, the system will enforce that the products are called off with the same "
"packaging as the one defined on the blanket order lines. If not checked, the system "
"will not take care of the packaging defined on the blanket order lines when calling off"
" products nor the one on the call-off order lines."
msgstr ""
"Si está marcado, los productos deberán liberarse con el mismo embalaje definido en las "
"líneas del pedido marco. Si no está marcado, el embalaje no se tendrá en cuenta en las "
"liberaciones."

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
msgid ""
"If checked, when a sales order is confirmed and some lines refer to a blanket order, "
"these lines will be automatically moved to a new call-off order."
msgstr ""
"Si se activa, al confirmar un pedido de venta las líneas vinculadas a un pedido marco "
"se trasladarán automáticamente a un pedido de liberación."

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
msgid ""
"If enabled, blanket orders for this product can have overlapping validityperiods. By "
"default, overlap is not allowed, ensuring only one active blanket order applies at a "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Si se activa, un producto puede tener pedidos marco con periodos de vigencia solapados."
" Por defecto se prohíbe el solapamiento para garantizar un único pedido marco activo "
"cada vez."

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
msgid ""
"If the blanket order does not have enough available quantity, the call-off order will "
"be generated with the available quantity and the original sale order line will be split"
" into two lines: one line with the available quantity and one line with the remaining "
"quantity. All the lines related to\n"
"                            a blanket order will be moved to a new call-off order and "
"the new call-off order will be confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Si el pedido marco no tiene suficiente cantidad disponible, se generará una liberación "
"por la cantidad disponible y la línea original se dividirá en dos: cantidad disponible "
"y cantidad restante. Las líneas vinculadas al pedido marco se trasladarán al nuevo "
"pedido de liberación, que se confirmará."

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, a call-off order will be generated from a sale order if the "
"sale order contains products\n"
"                            that are part of an open blanket order. The call-off order "
"will be generated with the same products and quantities as the\n"
"                            sale order provided that the blanket order has enough "
"available quantity."
msgstr ""
"Si se activa, los productos de un pedido de venta que pertenezcan a un pedido marco "
"abierto generarán un pedido de liberación con las mismas referencias y cantidades, "
"siempre que haya suficiente cantidad pendiente."

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
msgid ""
"Indicates if the blanket order needs to be finalized. This field is a technical field "
"used to manage the end-of-life of the blanket orders. To avoid costly operations to "
"determine if the blanket order needs to be finalized once the validity period is "
"reached, the system will set this field to True when a blanket order is confirmed. To "
"know if a blanket order needs to be finalized, the system will search for the blanket "
"orders with this field set to True and the validity period reached.Once the blanket "
"order is finalized, the system will set this field to False. In this way, the DB will "
"always contain less records to search with this field set to True."
msgstr ""
"Indica si el pedido marco está pendiente de finalizar. Es un campo técnico que gestiona"
" el fin de vigencia de los pedidos marco. Para evitar cálculos costosos, se activa al "
"confirmar el pedido y permite localizar los pedidos cuya vigencia ha terminado. Cuando "
"se finaliza el pedido marco, se desactiva. Así se reduce el número de registros que "
"debe revisar el sistema."

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
msgid ""
"Indicates if the end-of-life strategy can be edited. By default, the end-of-life "
"strategy can be edited while the blanket order is not finalized."
msgstr ""
"Indica si puede modificarse la estrategia de fin de vigencia. Se puede editar mientras "
"no se haya finalizado el pedido marco."

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
msgid "Indicates if the reservation strategy can be edited."
msgstr "Indica si se puede modificar la estrategia de reserva."

