#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
msgid ""
"The quantity remaining to consume by call-off orders in case of a blanket order. This "
"quantity is the difference between the quantity not yet delivered or part of a pending "
"delivery and the ordered quantity."
msgstr ""
"Cantidad pendiente de consumir mediante liberaciones de un pedido marco. Se calcula "
"teniendo en cuenta la cantidad pedida y la ya entregada o pendiente de entrega."

#. module: sale_order_blanket_order
